{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781550637863,"sessionID":"ses_1334ec25dffedJxBi9Erg6ELZ6","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_mIRqQn70GmDhskbR3jiSMKS2","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/task.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/task.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Travel Reimbursement Audit\n2: \n3: You are auditing a travel reimbursement request.\n4: \n5: Read all files in this folder. Apply the current finance policy, classify each expense, calculate the reimbursable total, and identify approved, capped or partially reimbursed, and rejected items.\n6: \n7: Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder. The goal is to leave behind useful audit artifacts that another finance reviewer could inspect.\n8: \n9: Your work must make the policy-selection step, item-level audit step, and reimbursement-summary step visible as separate checkpoints.\n\n(End of file - total 9 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Travel Reimbursement Audit\n\nYou are auditing a travel reimbursement request.\n\nRead all files in this folder. Apply the current finance policy, classify each expense, calculate the reimbursable total, and identify approved, capped or partially reimbursed, and rejected items.\n\nCreate the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder. The goal is to leave behind useful audit artifacts that another finance reviewer could inspect.\n\nYour work must make the policy-selection step, item-level audit step, and reimbursement-summary step visible as separate checkpoints.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/task.md","text":"# Travel Reimbursement Audit\n\nYou are auditing a travel reimbursement request.\n\nRead all files in this folder. Apply the current finance policy, classify each expense, calculate the reimbursable total, and identify approved, capped or partially reimbursed, and rejected items.\n\nCreate the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder. The goal is to leave behind useful audit artifacts that another finance reviewer could inspect.\n\nYour work must make the policy-selection step, item-level audit step, and reimbursement-summary step visible as separate checkpoints.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/task.md","time":{"start":1781550637829,"end":1781550637861}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_030f11fc7b6a72d8016a304e2de7b08191aef6ea6ae093b6ce"}},"id":"prt_eccb162fb0010pFcqsSlNMDTCV","sessionID":"ses_1334ec25dffedJxBi9Erg6ELZ6","messageID":"msg_eccb154f600115HAKKJzHU8eDs"}}
